  "notes": "Adds allocation-free, failure-only observation of ordinary shared-bus I2C HAL reads: raw error, duration, address, request size, timeout and CPU core are retained for explicit USB diagnostics. Actual MCU linkage was verified through ELF literals and the linker map. All 31 focused host suites and the normal PlatformIO build passed; USB installation, normal startup, connected Twin Button and unchanged 64-row flashlight learning data were verified. The first five-minute passive window had no failed HAL reads or additional bus invalidation/detach; CRT remained Ready and primary IR remained Missing. Sensor thresholds, recovery policy, pins and radio admission are unchanged. Intermittent CRT read failures and primary IR absence are not claimed resolved.",
